<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA BEAT BANGLADESH BY NINE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BEAT BANGLADESH BY NINE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India defeated Bangladesh by nine wickets in their rain-affected Asia Cup match on Thursday to earn a place in Saturday's final against Sri Lanka.</p>
<p>Scores: Bangladesh 130-8 in 43 overs, India 132-1 in 15 overs.</p>
</text>
